###
POST http://localhost:8000/api/products/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
	"name": "Television",
	"price": 300.00,
	"stock": 14,
	"description": "An amazing new TV"    
}


